 @MasoMathiou  Here the cheapest available 5070ti was 900€ 1 week ago, now it's 840€. Having less performance in a lot of cases but having a tiny bit better RT performance and broader support for DLSS is not worth 200€ or even 140€ more for me.

I'd rather wait a year until more devs implement FSR 4.0 or deal with the hassle of using external programs to use DLSS on an AMD card than overpaying even more.

Don't get me wrong I'm not a fan of GPU prices in general ,and would rather have gotten the non existant AMD flag ship card if it was around 1000€, but 9070xt vs 5070ti or even 5080 one certainly has better bang for buck than the other 2.
